<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 194 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 194 ALL OUT V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, trailing West Indies by 141 runs on first innings, were 194 all out in their second innings on the third day of the fifth and final test at the WACA on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 243 and 194. West Indies 384.</p>
</text>
